the staged composition marks its accumulator as a simdgroup fragment: true
a duplicated fragment region hands the per-kernel term one triple per copy: true
the converted half boundary charges a positive scratch, once per kernel however many scopes: true
R control: tiles of exactly the limit, no converted boundary, compile and run: true
R control: the unconverted kernel is tensorized and declares no coordinate table: true
R wide: the same tiles plus the scope scratch are refused at Hardware_limits, requesting exactly tiles + scratch: true
F wide: tiles of limit - scratch with two converted scopes make the estimate exactly the limit: true
F wide: the at-limit estimate compiles, links and runs, computing the product: true
F wide: the source declares one table for its two converted scopes: true
